    "about_html": "<p>I am currently working as a <b>Project Engineer at CDAC Mumbai</b> in the Education and Training department, where I deliver lectures and conduct practical sessions on <b>Big Data Technologies, Machine Learning, and Generative AI</b> for the DBDA (Diploma in Big Data Analytics) program.</p>\n<p>I'm a Computer Engineering graduate and CDAC-certified professional with specialized training in <b>Hadoop, Spark, Kafka, Python, R, and Cloud Computing</b>. My expertise spans data engineering, advanced analytics, and building scalable data pipelines for real-time processing.</p>\n<p>My professional journey includes impactful internships at <b>Solar Industries India Ltd.</b> and <b>Clustor Computing</b>, where I developed real-time dashboards, performed time-series analysis, and built ML models. I've worked on diverse projects including <b>InsightHub</b> (analytics platform), <b>Therapy Connect</b> (AI-powered matching), and various data visualization dashboards.</p>\n<p>Beyond technical skills, I've served as <b>Technical Class Representative at CDAC</b> and <b>GDSC Technical Lead</b>, where I mentored 50+ students, organized technical workshops, and led coding competitions. I'm passionate about <b>Big Data, Cloud Technologies, and AI-driven solutions</b>, always eager to collaborate on innovative projects that create real-world impact.</p>",
